    <li><a href="https://akurasu.net/wiki/Super_Robot_Wars/V/Flow_Chart" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Akurasu Wiki — Super Robot Wars V: Flow Chart</a>（分支结构与 SR 条件清单，与完整流程表交叉核对）</li>
    <li><a href="https://akurasu.net/wiki/Super_Robot_Wars/V/Secrets" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Akurasu Wiki — Super Robot Wars V: Secrets</a>（隐藏要素总表：点数制、秘密剧本条件、纹章、周回）</li>
    <li><a href="https://akurasu.net/wiki/Super_Robot_Wars/V/Deployment_Chart" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Akurasu Wiki — Super Robot Wars V: Deployment Chart</a>（敌方编成、资金、掉落与增援触发，HARD 型；与 comp-bible 并列刊载）</li>
